/// Arrays.
///
///    A home for the array primitives, so that no other module has to reach
/// for `prim "..."` to use one. There is one so far, and the module exists as
/// much to say where the next belongs.
///
/// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
module {

    /// The array without its last element, and that element.
    ///
    /// Answers a pair: `(everything but the last, the last)`.
    public func popBack(xs) { prim "arrayPopBack" xs };

}
